      "text": "Design rules\n\n• Apple Human Interface Guidelines (macOS): sidebar source list, unified toolbar, sheets for decisions, alerts with Cancel as default, inspector, Quick Look.\n• Built on Slint's Cupertino style; runs on Windows, so Windows caption buttons stay.\n• No SF Pro / SF Symbols (Apple-only license): Inter + own stroke icons.\n• HTTP connection is always visible: protocol, host, latency, connections.\n• Text contrast WCAG AA in light and dark.\n• Name: HTTPorter (chosen 2026-10-29)."
